From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Faust <willtechnoduck@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 00:45:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: export ios_teb_tsd_offset so ARM64EC modules stop
 hardcoding a TSD slot

On iOS the TEB is recovered through TPIDRRO_EL0 plus a raw Apple TSD slot,
because x18 is clobbered across context switches. Which slot that is cannot
be known at build time: it is whichever one backs the pthread key ntdll-unix
creates for the TEB, and that key number depends on how many keys the process
has already handed out, which varies by device and by load order. Four
different slots have been observed on real devices (275, 276, 280, 284).

The unix side discovers the slot at process init and publishes it here. FEX
imports this as a data export, exactly as it already does for
__wine_syscall_dispatcher, rather than rediscovering it independently -- one
authoritative value, one place that can be wrong.

Zero means "not yet discovered" and is never a usable offset.

(cherry picked from commit ae1335b3d091cb8cf06392f6fd1d009b74428d82)
Madeira-commit: a4cf1f58a1cb31e65626e1920deed76a70559174
Rebased: clean
Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-26-wine-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 dlls/ntdll/loader.c   | 7 +++++++
 dlls/ntdll/ntdll.spec | 1 +
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
index ff6d4a4..4de99f5 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/loader.c
@@ -77,6 +77,13 @@ static DWORD (WINAPI *pCtrlRoutine)(void *);
 SYSTEM_DLL_INIT_BLOCK LdrSystemDllInitBlock = { 0xf0 };
 
 void *__wine_syscall_dispatcher = NULL;
+
+/* iOS-Mythic: byte offset from (TPIDRRO_EL0 & ~7) to the raw Apple TSD slot
+ * backing ios_teb_tls_key, discovered at process init by the unix loader and
+ * published here so ARM64EC modules (FEX) can import one authoritative value
+ * instead of hardcoding a slot they do not own. Zero means "not yet
+ * discovered" and must never be used as an offset. */
+unsigned int ios_teb_tsd_offset = 0;
 unixlib_handle_t __wine_unixlib_handle = 0;
 
 /* windows directory */
diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/ntdll.spec b/dlls/ntdll/ntdll.spec
index 3548e1c..f2dabdc 100644
--- a/dlls/ntdll/ntdll.spec
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/ntdll.spec
@@ -1772,6 +1772,7 @@
 @ extern -private -arch=arm64ec __wine_unix_call_dispatcher_arm64ec
 @ extern -private -arch=arm64ec p_ios_jit_translate_addr
 @ extern -private -arch=arm64,arm64ec p_ios_jit_reverse_translate_addr
+@ extern -private ios_teb_tsd_offset
 @ extern -private __wine_unixlib_handle
 
 # Debugging
